# E10 -- training length. E8b learned the full-question input far more slowly than
# E0 learned its input, and ended 8 epochs with train loss ~1.33 (E0: 0.57-1.09),
# so "the full question does not help" and "it needs more training" cannot yet be
# told apart. E0 itself was still improving at its last epoch on 2 of 5 seeds.
#
# Two configurations, both at 16 epochs, differing ONLY in the input:
#   E10_base_16ep   = E0  with --epochs 16   (control: what does longer training alone do?)
#   E10_fullq_16ep  = E8b with --epochs 16   (the full question, given the training it needs)
#   E10_fullq_16ep vs E10_base_16ep = the value of the full question at equal, adequate training
# The input flags for E10_fullq_16ep are on its lines in the lane files.
# Warmup stays 10% of all steps (1.6 epochs) and the cosine decay stretches to 16
# epochs, identically for both; the best epoch is still chosen on the train slice.

# unchanged from E0
--model microsoft/deberta-v3-large
--batch-size 16
--lr 1e-5
--head-lr 1e-4
--llrd 0.95
--loss ce

# changed: training length (was 8)
--epochs 16

# operational (1024-token runs peak at ~16.7 GB when sharing; 512-token at ~9 GB)
--max-vram-gb 18
--save-model
--push-to-hub
